{"id":"2c15e9656c322806","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-relative-ce.md","title":"相对可计算与相对 c.e. 集合","display":"df-relative-ce — 相对可计算与相对 c.e. 集合","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-relative-ce","aliases":["20-df-relative-ce"],"display":"df-relative-ce — 相对可计算与相对 c.e. 集合","chapter":"3","section":"3.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorems 3.3.15–3.3.16","source_pdf_pages":[94,95],"source_printed_pages":[58,59],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-df-characteristic]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-relative-ce"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-relative-ce</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relative-ce — 相对可计算与相对 c.e. 集合"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorems 3.3.15–3.3.16"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>94</span><span>95</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58</span><span>59</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative\\text{-}ce}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nW_e^A:=\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^A),\\quad\n\\mathcal E^A:=\\{W_e^A:e\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R^A:=\\{B\\subseteq\\omega:\\chi_B\\in\\mathcal C_1^A\\},\\quad\n(\\mathcal C_k^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}:=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k^A:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative\\text{-}ce}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nW_e^A:=\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^A),\\quad\n\\mathcal E^A:=\\{W_e^A:e\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R^A:=\\{B\\subseteq\\omega:\\chi_B\\in\\mathcal C_1^A\\},\\quad\n(\\mathcal C_k^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}:=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k^A:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>oracle 为空时恢复普通可计算性。相对 c.e. 只要求 oracle 机器在肯定实例停止，否定实例可以发散。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorems 3.3.15–3.3.16；印刷页 58, 59；PDF 第 94, 95 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-characteristic]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative\\text{-}ce}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nW_e^A:=\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^A),\\qu